      <div><p class="lp-kicker">The CallTeam buying desk / 09</p><h1>8 best <span>HubSpot CRM alternatives</span> <small>for small sales teams.</small></h1><p class="lp-intro">Before you upgrade HubSpot, see what your team would pay elsewhere and what you would lose by switching.</p><div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-button" href="#comparison">Compare the 8 alternatives ↓</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="#team-cost">See the five-user costs →</a></div><p class="hs-brands">Pipedrive · Close · Zoho CRM · Freshsales · monday CRM · Salesforce · Microsoft Dynamics 365 · Attio</p></div>
      <aside class="lp-brief" aria-labelledby="hs-brief-title"><p class="lp-kicker">Before the upgrade</p><h2 id="hs-brief-title">Does the bigger bill<br>earn its place?</h2><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Name the missing feature.</strong><p>Sequences, reporting or a better calling workflow?</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Price the plan that includes it.</strong><p>The cheapest tier may leave the same gap.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Check what moving breaks.</strong><p>History, forms and follow-up still need to work.</p></div></li></ol><a href="#stay-or-switch">Decide whether to keep HubSpot →</a></aside>
