  <section class="lp-section" id="switching"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">05 / Protect the work already done</p><h2>Move ten records<br>before moving the team.</h2><p>Pick a current deal, an old customer, a contact with several activities and someone who asked you to stop. Check them in the new CRM before cancelling HubSpot.</p></div>
    <div class="hs-two"><div><h3>A CSV is only the start.</h3><p>HubSpot record exports contain properties and selected associations. Activity history and attachments need separate handling. Working automations must be rebuilt or replaced.</p><ul class="hs-migration-list"><li><strong>Contacts and companies:</strong> preserve IDs, linked records, owners and custom fields.</li><li><strong>Sales history:</strong> inspect notes, emails, calls, files and associated deals.</li><li><strong>Open work:</strong> check callbacks, tasks, dates and stop requests.</li><li><strong>Connected tools:</strong> test forms, calendars, reporting and data sync.</li></ul><p class="lp-sources"><a href="https://knowledge.hubspot.com/import-and-export/export-records" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HubSpot record exports ↗</a> · <a href="https://knowledge.hubspot.com/account-management/export-your-content-and-data" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Activities, files and other exports ↗</a></p></div><div><h3>Test the next call.</h3><p>Open one sample contact. Read the last conversation, make a call and assign a dated callback to another rep. Then check that rep's queue. If the history or task is missing, fix the migration before importing the full list.</p><h3>What if you already use Apollo?</h3><p>Apollo has deals, tasks and pipeline reporting alongside its contact data. Check whether those cover your process or should sync with a dedicated CRM.</p><p>If the problem is finding useful contact numbers, our <a href="/resources/apollo-alternatives/">Apollo alternatives comparison</a> addresses that buying decision. Use the <a href="/resources/how-to-buy-cold-calling-leads/">mobile vs company number guide</a> to decide what to call first.</p><p class="lp-sources"><a href="https://knowledge.apollo.io/hc/en-us/articles/4415062467725-Deals-Overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apollo deals and pipeline tools ↗</a></p></div></div>
    <div class="gr-resources" aria-labelledby="hs-resources-title"><h3 id="hs-resources-title">Have the opening ready for your first call.</h3><p>Once the records are ready, choose a script for your buyer and check the wording before the session.</p>{% include "components/free-calling-resources.njk" %}</div>
